Package: mandelbrot-renderer
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Interactive Mandelbrot and Julia set renderer
 An interactive C++ OpenGL application that renders the Mandelbrot
 and Julia sets with real-time navigation and zooming.
 .
 Features include:
  - Real-time Mandelbrot and Julia set rendering
  - Separate info window with cursor position and zoom level
  - Cursor-centered zoom and pan controls
  - Multithreaded calculation for optimal performance
  - Toggle between Mandelbrot and Julia sets
  - FreeType text rendering
